<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<Library LVVersion="21008000">
	<Property Name="NI.Lib.Description" Type="Str">Version 0.1.1  Update to include pre-post build process.  Moved version check to x.x.x
Version 0.2.0  Added support for scripting of Python orchestration code. 
Version 0.3.0  New status indicator with additional benchmark info. 
Version 0.4.0  Updates to proto files.   
Version 0.5.0  Support for mult-FIFO connections.  
Version 0.5.1 Update to Python orchestration scripting.  
Version 0.5.2 Update to support CIPC channels.
Version 0.6.0 Update to support CIPC FIFO channels.
Version 1.0.0 Support for Subpanels.
Version 1.0.1 Fix local error not causing clear error button to appear.
Version 1.1.0 Added support for plugin metadata.  Minor bugfix and UI updates.
Version 1.1.1 Bug fix for status display on plugins.  
Version 1.1.2 Bug fix for to display backpressurefifo channel type.
Version 1.1.3 Bug fix for swap on channel linking auto-populate.
Version 1.2.0 Update for new file locations to support Windows and Linux.
Version 1.2.1 UI adjustments for plugin list ordering and support for longer name display.
Version 1.2.2 UI performance optimization and muting of gRPC client timeout.  
Version 2.0.0 Breaking change.  Update to call external plugin loaders to load plugins as new process.  Update of gRPC core.
Version 3.0.0  Update to support changes to UI Core.
Version 3.0.1  Update to support changes to UI Core for plugin initialization.
Version 3.0.2  Update to support changes to UI Core for plugin initialization.
Version 3.1.0  Update to support changes to UI Core for plugin events.
Version 3.1.1  Create plugin name from type.
Version 3.1.2  Enable shutdown of process on close.</Property>
	<Property Name="NI.Lib.HelpPath" Type="Str"></Property>
